  "metaDescription": "Indonesian police searched a property linked to fired official Eko Hadi Santoso amid allegations of planning treason against President Prabowo.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "The Indonesian National Police have dismissed two-star general Eko Hadi Santoso following an ethics tribunal.",
    "Bareskrim investigators searched a property in South Jakarta reportedly used as a staging ground for alleged treason against the President.",
    "The former official was accused of involvement in unauthorized electronic surveillance using police equipment."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian National Police have taken formal action against high-ranking officers following an internal ethics investigation. Two-star police general Eko Hadi Santoso was recently dismissed from the force following findings related to illegal wiretapping operations using police resources. Following the dismissal, the Criminal Investigation Agency of the Indonesian National Police, known as Bareskrim, conducted a search of a residential property in the Cipete area of South Jakarta. According to authorities, the site was allegedly utilized as a command post for activities described as treasonous acts directed at President Prabowo. While the former general has expressed intent to challenge the dismissal through an appeals process, the police have established a specific committee to handle these pending appeals for involved personnel. Investigations into the alleged plot remain ongoing as officials continue to examine evidence recovered from the searched property.",
